--
--   **Context.** KFW C-layer 4: uniform truncation and uniform padding
--
--   * `truncU xD xN`: `KFH.truncP` with the divisor `2^Δ` read from `xD` and the item count from
--     `xN`; **`runQ_truncU`**: on records at scale `p + Δ` it gives `Q_p` at scale `p` (a fixed run).
--   * `padPreU xL xQ`, `padPostU xL xQ`: `KFN.padPre/padPost` with the lengths read from registers;
--     **`sImplQ_padU`**: a uniform program on `np ≥ n` records implements the same operator on `n`
--     records, padded (as `KFN.sImpl_pad`).
